# Fifteen days of tide in Chiloé's inner sea in a minute: hours 12 to 372 of the run
# from 2025-10-31 (after the first M2 period's spin-up), 6 model hours a second. Mesh
# km from the box's centre (43.95°S 74.1°W): Puerto Montt at 91, 274; Ancud, Chacao's
# western mouth, at 21, 232; Melinka at 28, 6. The views look east from over the
# Pacific, north on the left, the Andes behind and the sun's glint behind the camera.
# The closest, over the Gulf of Ancud to Puerto Montt, comes at the spring tide of
# 2025-11-05..07 (hours 120-168); the neap of 2025-11-12 (hour 288) from farther out.
# See viz/src/record.rs for the format; scripts/video/chiloe.toml.
# video_s  model_h  kind   X_km  Y_km  DIST_km  BEARING  PITCH
0          12       orbit  10    40    460      90       60
10         72       orbit  30    150   300      80       50
18         120      orbit  55    225   150      60       40
26         168      orbit  75    250   95       50       35
40         252      orbit  40    120   260      95       48
60         372      orbit  10    40    460      90       60
